## The command palette's descriptions of the Commands the Shell's global keymap lists (`lib_shell::keymap`).

command-help = show every key on this View
command-search = search the View on show
command-toggle-rail = show or hide the rail
command-focus-next = move focus to the next zone
command-focus-previous = move focus to the previous zone
command-dismiss-toasts = dismiss every Toast
command-toast-history = show this session's Toasts
command-jump-dashboard = net worth and budget health
command-jump-transactions = the transaction ledger
command-jump-documents = receipts, statements and what they prove
command-jump-notifications = durable notifications (not built yet)
command-jump-cash = cash and bank balances (not built yet)
command-jump-inventory = what you own (not built yet)
command-jump-loans = what you owe on loans (not built yet)
command-jump-credit-cards = card balances (not built yet)
command-jump-investments = holdings and returns (not built yet)
command-jump-bills = recurring and upcoming bills
command-jump-budgets = category limits and actuals
command-jump-reports = net worth and variance reports
command-jump-settings = ledger preferences
